From 44437ec4f6bd5591facf2b44493a2f010920a1ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 16:09:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: make session actions live and spot GA4 collect

Refresh chrome://aegis while it stays open, log bounce clears, add a
Canvas probe, show PII redaction counts, and block first-party GA4
collect copies that use custom paths or v=2+tid=G- query artifacts.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
